  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Gestin Fiscal del Estado de Baha</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Management in the State of Bahia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es mejorar la eficiencia y transparencia en la gestin fiscal del Estado de Baha, con el fin de lograr una mayor eficacia en la administracin del gasto y en la capacidad de fiscalizacin y recaudacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general object of the Program is to improve the efficiency and transparency in the fiscal management of the State of Bahia, with the purpose of obtaining a greater effectiveness in the administration and in the capacity of control and tax collection.</narrative>
  </description>
